        "Id1": {
            "text": "The Fellowship of the Ring was written by J.R.R. Tolkien and was released on July 29, 1954. The Fellowship of the Ring is considered fantasy and was published by George Allen & Unwin. The sequel to The Fellowship of the Ring was The Two Towers."
        },
